### ========== ADMIN FLOW ==========
@host = http://localhost:8081
@ts = {{$timestamp}}

### 1) Admin login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email":"admin@eventbooker.rs", "password":"admin123" }

### 2) Admin kreira novu kategoriju
POST {{host}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":"Kategorija-{{ts}}",
  "description":"Test kategorija {{ts}}"
}

### 3) List korisnika (ADMIN only, 200)
GET {{host}}/api/users?page=1&size=10

### 4) Logout admin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout


### ========== CREATOR FLOW ==========
### 5) Creator login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email":"creator1@eventbooker.rs", "password":"lozinka123" }

### 6) Creator kreira event u poslednjoj (gore napr.) kategoriji
# ako ne znaš ID, privremeno koristi 1 ili pročitaj /api/categories i izaberi
POST {{host}}/api/ems/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title":"Koncert {{ts}}",
  "description":"Opis {{ts}}",
  "scheduledAt":"2025-12-31T20:30:00",
  "location":"Beograd Arena",
  "maxCapacity": 50,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "tags": ["muzika","rock"]
}

### 7) Public list/filter radi
GET {{host}}/api/events?page=1&size=5&tag=rock

### 8) Creator vidi svoje RSVP-ove (trebalo bi 200, autor ili ADMIN)
# Stavi pravi eventId iz odgovora kreiranja (ili isprobaj sa 1 ako već postoji)
GET {{host}}/api/ems/events/1/rsvps?page=1&size=10

### 9) Logout creator
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
